  "scope": "Local security backport: extend the existing repeated-extglob guard to unescaped wildcard stars in every branch count, after preserving its proved-safe character-class flattening. Risky patterns are literalized using the existing fallback. No upstream release or general regex-safety claim. The repeated-extglob helpers are extracted verbatim around the local guard into lib/extglob-guard.js so the parser remains below the repository warning threshold; no threshold is raised.",
